      <p>oikos St. Gallen is a non-profit association (Verein) under Swiss law, based at the University of St. Gallen. oikos Solar is a project of the association and is not a separate legal entity.</p>
      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>The content of this website has been prepared with care. oikos St. Gallen does not guarantee the accuracy, completeness or timeliness of the information provided. Liability claims regarding damage caused by the use of any information provided are excluded to the extent permitted by law.</p>
      <p>Consulting outputs described on this site are decision-oriented analyses and recommendations. Legal interpretation and formal compliance should be validated with qualified experts.</p>
